note sh_mix_neg: a ulong value shifted by an int amount of -1 traps 7 (exit 107) in omc: the sign-extended
note amount is at or past the width when compared unsigned. "n\n" comes first.
text t "n\n"
fn shn a ulong s int to ulong
ret shl a s
end
fn main to int
w = write 1 t 0 2
x = shn 1 -1
ret int and x 255
end
